  "determination": true,
  "rationale": "`assets/skills/habeas/SKILL.md` is a bundled skill with front matter, so it is a site of `requirements.cli.skill_conventions`. Its `description` says when to use the skill in terms of the user's task: \"at the start of any work in a project that tracks requirements with Habeas\". It gives concrete signs of such a project and maps task types (design or change, moves, validation findings, adoption) to the other bundled skills. Naming other skills is permitted (MAY). The description also covers its role as the reference for syntax and `habeas status`/`habeas info`. The requirement has no other obligations for this site, and no violation queries apply.",
